<title>UK: VCI sees 96 results in line with forecasts.</title>
<headline>VCI sees 96 results in line with forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British video and audio publishing group VCI Plc said on Thursday it expected results for the year ended December 31, 1996 to be in line with expectations after what it called successful Christmas sales.</p>
<p>VCI said its key products sold strongly both in Britain and the U.S. during Christmas.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>For 1995, VCI group reported pretax profit of 8.0 million stg on turnover of 76.6 million.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
